// Title: Map of internet peers
// Visualization: map
// Map: lat=Latitude lon=Longitude label=ForeignAddr size=Connections
// Why: Geolocation of public peer addresses (approximate, from ADX's built-in GeoIP data). Unexpected countries for this organisation are worth a look.
NetConns()
| where ForeignPublic
| summarize Connections = count() by ForeignAddr
| extend Geo = geo_info_from_ip_address(ForeignAddr)
| extend Latitude = todouble(Geo.latitude), Longitude = todouble(Geo.longitude)
| where isnotnull(Latitude)
